#: ../../source/debugging.rst:28
msgid "Environment Variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:30
msgid ""
"The following environment variables are useful when the above exceptions "
"are encountered during kernel development."
msgstr "在内核开发过程中遇到上述异常时，以下环境变量会非常有用。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:34
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_ENABLE_CRASH_DUMP=1`` to enable dumping an archive "
"including the TileIR bytecode for submitting a bug report on "
":class:`TileCompilerExecutionError` or :class:`TileCompilerTimeoutError`."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``CUDA_TILE_ENABLE_CRASH_DUMP=1`` 以在发生 "
":class:`TileCompilerExecutionError` 或 :class:`TileCompilerTimeoutError` "
"时转储包含 TileIR 字节码的归档文件，便于提交错误报告。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:39
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_COMPILER_TIMEOUT_SEC`` to limit the time the TileIR "
"compiler `tileiras` can take."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``CUDA_TILE_COMPILER_TIMEOUT_SEC`` 以限制 TileIR 编译器 ``tileiras`` "
"允许消耗的最长时间。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:42
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_LOGS=CUTILEIR`` to print cuTile Python IR during "
"compilation to stderr. This is useful when debugging "
":class:`TileTypeError`."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``CUDA_TILE_LOGS=CUTILEIR`` 以在编译期间将 cuTile Python IR 打印到 stderr。这在调试 "
":class:`TileTypeError` 时很有帮助。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:46
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_LOGS=TILEIR`` to print TileIR text to stderr. Requires "
"CUDA Toolkit 13.4 or later."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``CUDA_TILE_LOGS=TILEIR`` 以将 TileIR 文本打印到 stderr。需要 CUDA Toolkit 13.4 "
"或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:49
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_DUMP_TILEIR`` to a directory to save TILEIR text to "
"files. Requires CUDA Toolkit 13.4 or later."
msgstr ""
"将 ``CUDA_TILE_DUMP_TILEIR`` 设置为某个目录，可将 TILEIR 文本保存到文件中。需要 CUDA Toolkit "
"13.4 或更高版本。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:52
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_TEMP_DIR`` to configure the directory for storing "
"temporary files."
msgstr "设置 ``CUDA_TILE_TEMP_DIR`` 以配置用于存放临时文件的目录。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:55
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_CACHE_DIR`` to configure the directory for the bytecode-"
"to-cubin disk cache. Compiled cubins are cached here to avoid "
"recompilation of unchanged kernels. Set to ``0``, ``off``, ``none``, or "
"an empty string to disable caching. Defaults to ``~/.cache/cutile-"
"python``."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``CUDA_TILE_CACHE_DIR`` 以配置字节码到 cubin 的磁盘缓存目录。编译后的 cubin "
"会缓存在此目录中，以避免重复编译未修改的内核。将其设为 ``0`` 、 ``off`` 、 ``none`` 或空字符串可禁用缓存。默认路径为 "
"``~/.cache/cutile-python`` 。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:62
msgid ""
"Set ``CUDA_TILE_CACHE_SIZE`` to configure the maximum disk cache size in "
"bytes. Oldest entries are evicted when the cache exceeds this limit. "
"Defaults to 2 GB (2147483648)."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``CUDA_TILE_CACHE_SIZE`` 以配置磁盘缓存的最大字节数。当缓存超出此上限时，将淘汰最旧的条目。默认值为 2 "
"GB（2147483648）。"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:69
msgid "Inspecting the Compilation Cache"
msgstr "查看编译缓存"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:71
msgid ""
"Use the ``cutile-cache log`` command to page through cached compilations "
"in most-recently-accessed order. Each entry shows the kernel's mangled "
"name, compiler version, compilation date and duration, CUBIN size, and "
"optimization remarks::"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``cutile-cache log`` 命令按最近访问顺序分页查看缓存的编译记录。每条记录都会显示内核的修饰名（mangled "
"name）、编译器版本、编译日期与耗时、CUBIN 大小以及优化说明（remarks）::"

#: ../../source/debugging.rst:78
msgid ""
"Compilation remarks are captured in YAML format when using ``tileiras`` "
"13.4 or newer. Entries produced by earlier cuTile Python or compiler "
"versions remain readable but may show metadata as unavailable."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``tileiras`` 13.4 及更新版本时，编译优化说明会以 YAML 格式记录。早期 cuTile Python "
"或编译器版本生成的缓存记录仍可读取，但部分元数据可能会显示为不可用。"

